        "title": "MacBook Ultra is coming, here’s the latest on release timing",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/06/macbook-ultra-is-coming-heres-the-latest-on-release-timing/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/macbook-ultra-pro-mockup.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">MacBook Ultra is the <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/04/27/iphone-ultra-and-macbook-ultra-are-coming-this-year-per-report/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"1049889\">rumored name</a> for Apple’s exciting <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/24/macbook-ultra-is-coming-six-new-features-launching-this-fall/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"1043371\">MacBook Pro overhaul</a> with OLED, a touchscreen, Dynamic Island, and more. Here’s the latest on when to expect MacBook Ultra’s release.</p>",
